{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.LiTwoNegOne","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.LiTwoNegOne","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.ComplexDilogBridge","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.AlternatingZetaTwo","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.ComplexDilogarithmBoundary"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.cLiTwoExt_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.cLiTwoExt_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/LiTwoNegOne.lean#L46-L52","doc":"**The continuation's value at `−1`**, which is what the Landen argument\nconsumes. `−1` is on the boundary of the disc, so this needs\n`cLiTwoExt_eq_cLiTwo_of_norm_le_one`, not the open-disc agreement. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.cLiTwo_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.cLiTwo_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/LiTwoNegOne.lean#L37-L44","doc":"The same for the complex series, through `cLiTwo_ofReal`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.LiTwo_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.LiTwo_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/LiTwoNegOne.lean#L31-L35","doc":"**`LiTwo(−1) = −π²/12`.** The corpus's series at `x = −1` is exactly the\nalternating `ζ(2)`, termwise. ","signatureChunk":0}]}